# Public pages: no login needed (shared WhatsApp job links, landing site).

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Search jobs without logging in
# @name search
GET {{base}}/public/jobs?q=welder

### One job (no HR phone)
GET {{base}}/public/jobs/{{search.response.body.$.items[0].id}}

### Without a login, worker pages say 401
GET {{base}}/worker/profile
